; The library's lowering driver (lower_to_llvm_ir: the passes of
; populateCIRToLLVMPasses and mlir::translateModuleToLLVMIR, the verifiers
; off) against upstream's cir::direct::lowerDirectlyFromCIRToLLVMIR, on every
; stream of the cirgen tests: the LLVM IR must be identical.  A pin bump that
; changes what the upstream function does fails this test.
; REQUIRES: test-hooks
; RUN: %python %scripts/lowering_drift_tests.py %S %ecil-asm %edg-cir %t.d
